  <entry>
    <title>hexo 换字体（以LXGWWenKaiMonoGBScreen为例）</title>
    <link href="/2026/01/28/hexo-%E6%8D%A2%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%A5LXGWWenKaiMonoGBScreen%E4%B8%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%89/"/>
    <url>/2026/01/28/hexo-%E6%8D%A2%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%A5LXGWWenKaiMonoGBScreen%E4%B8%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%89/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="Hexo-Fluid-字体配置说明"><a href="#Hexo-Fluid-字体配置说明" class="headerlink" title="Hexo Fluid 字体配置说明"></a>Hexo Fluid 字体配置说明</h1><h2 id="1-基础字体配置"><a href="#1-基础字体配置" class="headerlink" title="1. 基础字体配置"></a>1. 基础字体配置</h2><p>在主题配置文件 <code>_config.yml</code> 中添加或修改以下内容：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-attr">font:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">font_size:</span> <span class="hljs-string">16px</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">font_family:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Noto Serif SC, serif&quot;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">code_font_size:</span> <span class="hljs-number">85</span><span class="hljs-string">%</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><code>font_size</code>: 设置全局字体大小。</li><li><code>font_family</code>: 设置全局字体族，支持系统字体和 Web Fonts。</li><li><code>code_font_size</code>: 设置代码块字体大小。</li></ul><h2 id="2-使用-Google-Fonts"><a href="#2-使用-Google-Fonts" class="headerlink" title="2. 使用 Google Fonts"></a>2. 使用 Google Fonts</h2><p>若要使用 Google Fonts，可将 <code>font_family</code> 设置为如下格式：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs yaml"><span class="hljs-attr">font:</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">font_family:</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Noto Serif SC, serif&quot;</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">enable:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">host:</span> <span class="hljs-string">https://fonts.loli.net</span><br>  <span class="hljs-attr">global:</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">external:</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">family:</span> <span class="hljs-string">Noto</span> <span class="hljs-string">Serif</span> <span class="hljs-string">SC</span><br>    <span class="hljs-attr">size:</span> <span class="hljs-string">16px</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="3-自定义字体文件"><a href="#3-自定义字体文件" class="headerlink" title="3. 自定义字体文件"></a>3. 自定义字体文件</h2><p>将字体文件放入 <code>source/fonts/</code> 目录下，例如：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs info">source/<br>└── fonts/<br>    ├── fira-code-v12-latin-regular.woff<br>    └── noto-sans-sc-v12-chinese-simplified_latin-regular.woff<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后在 Stylus 变量文件 <code>source/css/_variables/base.styl</code> 中定义字体加载规则。</p><h2 id="4-引入自定义字体（通过-head-ejs）"><a href="#4-引入自定义字体（通过-head-ejs）" class="headerlink" title="4. 引入自定义字体（通过 head.ejs）"></a>4. 引入自定义字体（通过 head.ejs）</h2><p>打开 <code>themes/fluid/layout/_partial/head.ejs</code> 文件，在 <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> 标签中添加字体 CDN 链接：</p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs html"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">link</span> <span class="hljs-attr">rel</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;preconnect&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">href</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com&quot;</span>&gt;</span><br><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">link</span> <span class="hljs-attr">rel</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;preconnect&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">href</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;https://fonts.gstatic.com&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">crossorigin</span>&gt;</span><br><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">link</span> <span class="hljs-attr">href</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap&quot;</span> <span class="hljs-attr">rel</span>=<span class="hljs-string">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span>&gt;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="5-自定义-CSS-样式"><a href="#5-自定义-CSS-样式" class="headerlink" title="5. 自定义 CSS 样式"></a>5. 自定义 CSS 样式</h2><p>在 <code>themes/fluid/source/css/custom.css</code> 中添加自定义样式：</p><figure class="highlight css"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs css"><span class="hljs-selector-tag">body</span> &#123;<br>  <span class="hljs-attribute">font-family</span>: <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Noto Serif SC&quot;</span>, serif;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>以上配置可实现 Hexo Fluid 博客的个性化字体设置。</p><hr>]]></content>
    
    
    
